{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959890/extras/3831e565bf6e5d3644974231106f9950.poster.avif?t=1766070041\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959890/extras/3831e565bf6e5d3644974231106f9950.webm?t=1766070041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959890/extras/3831e565bf6e5d3644974231106f9950.mp4?t=1766070041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akemi is finally coming back to her hometown after years of studying abroad. Little does she know, her homecoming takes an unexpected turn when the mayor confronts her with an outrageous debt that must be paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akemi must find a way to pay off her debt, leading her to take up part-time jobs. By working, players earn valuable work experience, unlocking new job opportunities, and providing Akemi with the means to repay her debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959890/extras/699e79028ab04b3df35950eed8e24fa6.avif?t=1766070041\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, just what happened while she was away from home? As Akemi works towards her goal, she soon finds herself pulling at the thread of a number of mysteries involving the townsfolk.  There is a shadow that looms over the town, and events are put into motion which will change Akemi's life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND CRAFTED ANIMATIONS-</strong> Fully animated 2D sprite sex scenes!<